In Note mode, following a wiki link to a note that does not exist refuses to make one and says why.
note: Plan.md
scene: note
events: key:m+cmd@0.3 key:l@0.8 key:Enter+cmd@1.1
expect: text:crumb: 'Plan .md Single file'
expect: text:notice: 'This note is open as a file. Open its folder to add, rename, move or delete notes. Dismiss'
expect: file:*.md: Plan.md (20 bytes)
--- before
# Plan

- [[Other]]
